      "note": "rabim is the colloquial everyday verb for need; potrebujem is the standard one." },
    { "en": "I don't need help.",            "word": "Ne potrebujem pomoči. | Ne rabim pomoči." },
    { "en": "I am working now.",             "word": "Zdaj delam.",
